/*  A row that was made outside is grown inside a loop over the table that holds it.
    Obligation broken: O2, a store needs to know exactly where its target lives. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Define first as a series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define table as a series of series of number.
    Insert first into table.
    Pull a rabbit.
        For each row in table, repeat:
            Insert 5 into row.
        Done.
    Done.
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State first.
